riginal-dinerant":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/the-original-dinerant","n":"The Original Dinerant","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from American cuisine","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["The Original Dinerant, or simply The Original, was a diner serving American cuisine in Portland, Oregon, United States. Owned by Sage Hospitality Resources, Guy Fieri visited the \"modern\" and \"upscale\" diner to film a 2016 episode of the Food Network's Diners, Drive-Ins and Dives. The diner hosted competitive eating contests and other special events. The Original received a generally positive reception and was most known for its glazed doughnut sliders and alcoholic milkshakes. The restaurant's mezzanine level had an amusement arcade and bar called The Dinercade added in early 2019. The Original Dinerant closed permanently."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-the-original-dinerant"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Original_Dinerant"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["5-8 Club","dish/5-8-club"],["Altabira City Tavern","dish/altabira-city-tavern"],["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Applebee's","dish/applebee-s"],["Arby's","dish/arby-s"],["Arnold's Bar and Grill","dish/arnold-s-bar-and-grill"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Be Our Guest Restaurant","dish/be-our-guest-restaurant"],["Beer cake","dish/beer-cake"],["Ben's Chili Bowl","dish/ben-s-chili-bowl"],["Benjy's","dish/benjy-s"],["Besaw's","dish/besaw-s"],["Better than sex cake","dish/better-than-sex-cake"],["Blackhawk (restaurant)","dish/blackhawk-restaurant"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Blooming onion","dish/blooming-onion"],["Bobcat Bite","dish/bobcat-bite"],["Boiling Springs Tavern","dish/boiling-springs-tavern"],["Brix Tavern","dish/brix-tavern"],["Brown Betty (desser